    {
      "fileName": "reactive-transformation.json",
      "id": "4Q9Q41KLPYJMdV4b",
      "name": "Reactive Transformation",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "4Q9Q41KLPYJMdV4b",
        "folder": "xt9f1I4xC53PVsAK",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Reactive Transformation",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "reaction"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> varies</p><hr /><p>You transform reflexively when in danger. You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Untamed Form] to transform into one shape granted by one of the prerequisite feats you have, depending on the trigger. Your shape's resistances and weaknesses apply against the triggering damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fall 10 feet or more</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Choose a shape from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Aerial Form].</p><hr /><p><strong>Trigger</strong> You take bludgeoning or poison damage</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Choose a primal dragon shape from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dragon Form] that resists the triggering damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Trigger</strong> You take fire damage</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Choose a fire elemental shape from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Elemental Form].</p><hr /><p><strong>Trigger</strong> You take poison damage</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Choose a shape from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Plant Form].</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 14
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Untamed Form"
              },
              {
                "value": "Dragon Shape, Elemental Shape, Plant Shape, or Soaring Shape"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "druid"
            ]
          }
        },
